id=gta4xlwifi_wallpaper
name=Galaxy Tab S6 Lite: still default wallpapers
author=tabs6-lite, kusti420
description=The default and "Featured" wallpapers of the Galaxy S26 are six interactive videos, 805 MB in total: one eighth of the 6.13 GiB super partition of the tablet. Points those entries at the matching still images shipped in the same package and removes the videos. Adapted from the a52sxq wallpaper patch of the base.
